---

<section id="story" class="grid min-h-[600px] grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2" style="background: rgb(22,17,13);">
  <!-- Text column -->
  <div class="reveal reveal-left flex flex-col justify-center p-8 md:p-16 lg:p-20" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
    <p class="label mb-4">Open 24 / 7 · Baghdad</p>
    <h2 style="font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);">More Than a Café. It's Your Second Living Room.</h2>
    <div class="mt-6 mb-8 h-px w-10 bg-amber"></div>
    <p class="text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-cream-muted">
      Shadow Gaming Cafe opened on Palestine Street with one idea: give Baghdad a place that stays lit
      long after the rest of the city sleeps. PCs, a PS5, a billiard table and a proper drinks counter —
      all under one roof, all day and all night.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-cream-muted">
      From late-night ranked sessions to Gulf Cup watch parties on the big screen, the room fills with
      students, squads and regulars who keep coming back for the same reason: it's quiet when you need
      quiet, loud when you want loud, and open every single hour of the week.
    </p>
    <a
      href="#nights"
      class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-amber transition-all hover:underline"
    >
      See what's on this week <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Image column -->
  <div class="reveal reveal-right relative h-[280px] overflow-hidden md:h-auto" style="transition-delay: 250ms;">
    <img
      src={farmImage}
      alt="Shadow Gaming Cafe — play floor and lounge area"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: rgba(120,60,0,0.18);" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div
      class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 border border-amber/40 bg-espresso/80 px-4 py-3 backdrop-blur"
    >
      <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-amber">Palestine St.</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-cream">تقاطع النخلة — Baghdad</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>